 # Track 2: Standalone read-only TUI for durable message log
 
-
+Standalone TUI (not coupled to Pi harness) that renders the SQLite durable message log. Read-only MVP — send happens via CLI or other client. Can begin sketching against a mock once C1 (TAT-71) schema is frozen. TUI hydration contract (how it reconstructs room state from SQLite on startup) is explicitly in-scope. Read-only MVP scope: renders room transcript, shows participant list, handles cursor-based scroll/navigation. Full send-capable TUI is post-MVP. Decoupled from session-broker model entirely — reads from SQLite, not from live broker events. Parallel-ready with Track 1 once C1 schema is stable.
